Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Removes the silent handlers added by apply.reg. Only use this if you have NOT
; since installed Xbox Game Bar (it would remove Game Bar's own registration).
; The per-user Game Bar toggles are left as they are.

[-HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Classes\ms-gamebar]
[-HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Classes\ms-gamebarservices]
[-HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Classes\ms-gamingoverlay]
